00:13:39.135 --> 00:13:40.904
All right.

00:13:40.904 --> 00:13:46.976
I could have one lone pair.

00:13:46.976 --> 00:13:49.379
And this will all
make a lot of sense.

00:13:49.379 --> 00:13:53.349
Two lone pairs and so on.

00:13:53.349 --> 00:13:55.151
We'll keep going
as we get there.

00:13:55.151 --> 00:14:00.223
OK, so I'm going to start
with a very simple case.

00:14:00.223 --> 00:14:02.525
I'm going to start with this.

00:14:02.525 --> 00:14:03.226
Right.

00:14:03.226 --> 00:14:06.996
And then we're going to put some
stuff into that table as we go.

00:14:06.996 --> 00:14:07.497
All right.

00:14:07.497 --> 00:14:13.503
So look if I have H, Be H,
