00:19:15.004 --> 00:19:18.374
and no LP.

00:19:18.374 --> 00:19:19.675
OK.

00:19:19.675 --> 00:19:24.514
And so now if I have
three electron domains,

00:19:24.514 --> 00:19:29.485
three electron domains, which
I have, then the max separation

00:19:29.485 --> 00:19:36.559
for this case, max sep is going
to be for them to spread out

00:19:36.559 --> 00:19:38.294
