00:21:52.962 --> 00:21:54.897
There's no lone pairs.

00:21:54.897 --> 00:21:55.798
There's no lone pairs.

00:21:55.798 --> 00:21:56.966
So hold on.

00:21:56.966 --> 00:22:02.972
If I go to two, I've
got three bonding pairs

00:22:02.972 --> 00:22:05.007
