00:22:08.711 --> 00:22:11.914
It's different, because
now this matters.

00:22:11.914 --> 00:22:13.516
Now this matters.

00:22:13.516 --> 00:22:15.818
Right, and so now--

00:22:15.818 --> 00:22:19.155
so now, I've got to add--

00:22:19.155 --> 00:22:23.559
