00:22:45.414 --> 00:22:47.550
This just goes with
what I wrote here.

00:22:47.550 --> 00:22:51.420
Right, so I've got
differences in the molecule

00:22:51.420 --> 00:22:54.757
between the BPs.

00:22:54.757 --> 00:22:58.127
So you know now that I
got to give more space

00:22:58.127 --> 00:23:01.230
to this double bond
single bond repulsion

00:23:01.230 --> 00:23:03.466
than to these two single bonds.

00:23:03.466 --> 00:23:06.202
All right.

00:23:06.202 --> 00:23:14.543
So step four for this case
is that the bond order

00:23:14.543 --> 00:23:16.479
