Sorry about that.

00:24:55.711 --> 00:25:01.317
Bond O. Trigonal planar,
trigonal planar, slightly bent.

00:25:01.317 --> 00:25:01.917
Look at this.

00:25:04.453 --> 00:25:05.688
I should have just kept this.

00:25:08.657 --> 00:25:16.398
Bent, bent, because
now, I've got--

00:25:16.398 --> 00:25:17.500
