00:25:46.829 --> 00:25:49.198
got a lone pair.

00:25:49.198 --> 00:25:51.667
Actually it's a lone
pair double bond,

00:25:51.667 --> 00:25:54.970
but it's still stronger than a
bond pair bond pair repulsion.

00:25:54.970 --> 00:25:58.641
Lone pair bond pair,
right in the middle

00:25:58.641 --> 00:26:01.544
is stronger than
bond pair bond pair.

00:26:01.544 --> 00:26:03.512
That's the rank order.

00:26:03.512 --> 00:26:06.515
So this will be bent.

00:26:06.515 --> 00:26:08.984
This will be bent.

00:26:08.984 --> 00:26:14.423
So I've got three
domains, and hold on,

00:26:14.423 --> 00:26:22.264
four LP more repulsive.

00:26:22.264 --> 00:26:28.604
Oh boy, repulsive, and
