00:27:14.350 --> 00:27:18.187
an example of that with smell.

00:27:18.187 --> 00:27:21.357
And yeah, right?

00:27:21.357 --> 00:27:22.157
Exactly.

00:27:22.157 --> 00:27:24.860
And actually, I think we
